# game/ch08.rpy:12
translate english ch8_1aeafc92:

    # n "周五晚上，阿狐盯着购物软件里那套心心念念的限量漫画书——官方店早已售罄。"
    n "Friday evening. Ahu stared at the limited comic set he'd been dreaming about in the shopping app — the official store had long sold out."

# game/ch08.rpy:13
translate english ch8_c8833633:

    # n "他试着搜索书名，刷出一家不起眼的小店：同款漫画，价格只要官方的一半，页面写着「现货秒发」。"
    n "He searched the title and up popped a humble little shop: same comics at half the official price, promising \"in stock, ships instantly\"."

# game/ch08.rpy:14
translate english ch8_52a80525:

    # mc laugh "还有这种好事？便宜一半！"
    mc laugh "How is that possible? Half price!"

# game/ch08.rpy:15
translate english ch8_71e5a54c:

    # n "店铺客服主动发来消息。"
    n "The shop's support agent messaged him first."

# game/ch08.rpy:16
translate english ch8_a3aa2532:

    # fraud laugh "同学好眼光！这套书全网断货，本店还剩最后3套，官方半价，先到先得！"
    fraud laugh "Great taste! This set is sold out everywhere — we have the last 3 at half the official price. First come, first served!"

# game/ch08.rpy:19
translate english ch8_452993b2:

    # fraud serious "平台下单要排队抢，直接加我微信，私下下单还能再减20元！"
    fraud serious "Ordering on the platform means queuing. Add me on WeChat — order privately and get another 20 yuan off!"

# game/ch08.rpy:33
translate english ch8_A_cffeba4f:

    # n "阿狐盯着「半价现货」，心里犯起了嘀咕。"
    n "Ahu eyed the \"half-price, in stock\" claim, feeling uneasy."

# game/ch08.rpy:34
translate english ch8_A_7f9af6d0:

    # think serious "全班同学都在抢这套书，官方店秒空，这家小店凭什么有货还半价？老师说过，明显低于市场价的，多半是陷阱！"
    think serious "The whole class is hunting this set and the official store empties in seconds — how does this little shop have stock at half price? Teacher said anything way below market price is usually a trap!"

# game/ch08.rpy:35
translate english ch8_A_d63d73c0:

    # mc serious "便宜一半还「私下交易」，八成是假店。我还是在官方店蹲补货，或者请妈妈帮忙。"
    mc serious "Half price AND private deals? It's probably a fake shop. I'll wait for the official store's restock or ask Mom for help."

# game/ch08.rpy:36
translate english ch8_A_8506adc4:

    # n "阿狐截图举报了这家小店，把想法告诉了妈妈。妈妈帮他设置了到货提醒，一周后官方店真的补了货。"
    n "Ahu screenshot-reported the shop and told Mom his thinking. She set a restock alert for him — and a week later the official store really restocked."

# game/ch08.rpy:39
translate english ch8_A_d62a46e8:

    # police laugh "警惕性满分！「限量缺货+超低价」是假店的经典诱饵。记住：价格明显低于行情的「现货」，要么是假货，要么是骗局，下单务必走官方平台！"
    police laugh "Full marks for vigilance! \"Limited stock + rock-bottom price\" is the classic fake-shop bait. Remember: \"in stock\" far below market price is either counterfeit or a scam — always order through official platforms!"

# game/ch08.rpy:51
translate english ch8_B_d4c19956:

    # mc confused "为什么你家能比官方便宜一半？私下买为什么还能再减20？"
    mc confused "Why are you half the official price? And why another 20 off for private orders?"

# game/ch08.rpy:52
translate english ch8_B_c6a37763:

    # fraud laugh "我们是厂家内部渠道，不用给平台交抽成，自然便宜！私下下单省的20元，就是平台抽成那部分，返给你！"
    fraud laugh "We're a factory insider channel — no platform commission, so naturally cheaper! The 20 yuan you save privately is exactly the commission we skip, returned to you!"

# game/ch08.rpy:53
translate english ch8_B_ecb20c2f:

    # n "对方发来一套高仿的「店铺页面」和一长串「买家好评」截图，看着无可挑剔。"
    n "The scammer sent a counterfeit \"shop page\" and a long string of \"buyer reviews\" — impeccable at a glance."

# game/ch08.rpy:54
translate english ch8_B_77d2b1a3:

    # fraud serious "机会稍纵即逝，加微信转定金50元，立马锁单发货！"
    fraud serious "Opportunities vanish fast! Add me on WeChat, send a 50-yuan deposit, and your order locks and ships immediately!"

# game/ch08.rpy:68
translate english ch8_B1_c751779e:

    # n "阿狐拿着手机到客厅找妈妈。"
    n "Ahu took his phone to the living room to find Mom."

# game/ch08.rpy:69
translate english ch8_B1_3fd78549:

    # think worried "好评一大堆，看着挺靠谱的……可私下转账总感觉不踏实，还是问问妈妈。"
    think worried "Lots of glowing reviews, seems reliable... but private transfers feel unsteady. Ask Mom."

# game/ch08.rpy:70
translate english ch8_B1_5fe0c640:

    # mc worried "妈妈，这家店漫画半价，让我加微信私下转定金，你看靠谱吗？"
    mc worried "Mom, this shop sells the comics at half price and wants me to add WeChat and send a deposit privately. Does that seem legit?"

# game/ch08.rpy:71
translate english ch8_B1_0008ad4f:

    # mom serious "宝贝，这是「虚假网购」骗局！你看，这些好评截图的水印都是同一批，是批量伪造的。私下转账没有平台保护，钱一转，人就找不到了。"
    mom serious "Sweetie, this is the \"fake online shop\" scam! Look — all these review screenshots share the same watermark; they're mass-produced. Private transfers have no platform protection: once the money's sent, they're gone."

# game/ch08.rpy:72
translate english ch8_B1_b6425090:

    # n "妈妈陪阿狐举报了店铺，带他在官方平台预约了补货通知。"
    n "Mom helped Ahu report the shop and set up a restock notification on the official platform."

# game/ch08.rpy:75
translate english ch8_B1_a96f6ba7:

    # police laugh "做得对！网购认准官方平台，交易全程有保障。让你「绕开平台私下转账」的，十个有十个是骗子！"
    police laugh "Exactly right! Shop only on official platforms where the whole transaction is protected. Nine out of ten who push you to \"skip the platform and transfer privately\" are scammers!"

# game/ch08.rpy:87
translate english ch8_B2_82e04971:

    # mc serious "减20元我就不要了。交易必须走官方平台，下单、付款、售后都有保障。私下转账，我不参与。"
    mc serious "Keep the 20 yuan. Deals go through the official platform — ordering, payment, and after-sales are all protected there. I won't transfer privately."

# game/ch08.rpy:88
translate english ch8_B2_595a7c62:

    # fraud serious "官方平台没货！你爱买不买，最后3套马上被别人抢光了！"
    fraud serious "The official platform has no stock! Take it or leave it — the last 3 sets are about to be snatched up!"

# game/ch08.rpy:89
translate english ch8_B2_c054db7f:

    # think serious "真卖家不怕平台监管，怕监管的一定有问题。"
    think serious "A real seller doesn't fear platform oversight — whoever fears it has something to hide."

# game/ch08.rpy:90
translate english ch8_B2_27456a9d:

    # n "阿狐不再理会。两周后，班级里有同学在同款小店私下转账600元，钱转过去立刻被拉黑。"
    n "Ahu ignored it. Two weeks later, a classmate transferred 600 yuan privately to a shop just like it — and got blocked the moment the money landed."

# game/ch08.rpy:93
translate english ch8_B2_e167d271:

    # police serious "你守住了「平台交易」这条底线！平台担保就是你网购的「安全气囊」，谁劝你跳过平台，谁就想拆掉你的安全气囊！"
    police serious "You held the \"platform deals only\" line! Platform protection is your shopping airbag — anyone telling you to skip the platform wants to remove your airbag!"

# game/ch08.rpy:105
translate english ch8_B3_89fdefe4:

    # n "阿狐看着满屏好评，信以为真，加了微信转了50元定金。"
    n "Convinced by the wall of reviews, Ahu added the WeChat and sent a 50-yuan deposit."

# game/ch08.rpy:106
translate english ch8_B3_4ca7fb51:

    # n "转账成功后，对方却让他再付全款260元，「凑单一起发货，不然定金不退」。"
    n "After the transfer, the scammer demanded the full 260 yuan too — \"combine the order or the deposit is forfeit\"."

# game/ch08.rpy:107
translate english ch8_B3_1b9f080c:

    # think serious "等等……定金都转了，怎么还要我付全款？说好的发货呢？"
    think serious "Wait... I already sent the deposit — why pay in full now? What about shipping?"

# game/ch08.rpy:108
translate english ch8_B3_77cab54f:

    # mc serious "我不付了，把定金退给我！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying. Return my deposit!"

# game/ch08.rpy:109
translate english ch8_B3_094c57a1:

    # n "对方先是拖延，接着把阿狐拉黑了。50元定金打了水漂。"
    n "The scammer stalled, then blocked Ahu. The 50-yuan deposit was gone."

# game/ch08.rpy:110
translate english ch8_B3_7105807a:

    # n "阿狐把事情告诉妈妈，妈妈帮他向平台举报了店铺。"
    n "Ahu told Mom, who helped him report the shop to the platform."

# game/ch08.rpy:113
translate english ch8_B3_ed0a241c:

    # police serious "50元买了个教训！骗子先骗「定金」再逼「全款」，就是为了层层收割。记住：私下转账没有售后，出了事维权都难！"
    police serious "50 yuan bought a lesson! Scammers take the \"deposit\" first, then push for \"full payment\" — harvesting layer by layer. Remember: private transfers have no after-sales support, and disputes are nearly impossible to fight!"

# game/ch08.rpy:125
translate english ch8_C_0b39f9b1:

    # n "阿狐怕错过「最后3套」，加了微信转了50元定金。"
    n "Afraid of missing the \"last 3 sets\", Ahu added the WeChat and sent a 50-yuan deposit."

# game/ch08.rpy:126
translate english ch8_C_ec1583b2:

    # think laugh "半价漫画马上到手，全班第一份！"
    think laugh "Half-price comics on the way — first in the whole class!"

# game/ch08.rpy:127
translate english ch8_C_992cf2cf:

    # fraud laugh "定金收到！系统显示你的订单已进入发货队列！"
    fraud laugh "Deposit received! The system shows your order is in the shipping queue!"

# game/ch08.rpy:128
translate english ch8_C_d2a837cf:

    # fraud serious "叮！仓库提示你的订单状态异常，需再支付300元「订单激活费」解锁发货，否则定金和订单一并作废！"
    fraud serious "Ding! The warehouse flags your order as abnormal — pay another 300-yuan \"order activation fee\" to unlock shipping, or the deposit and order are voided together!"

# game/ch08.rpy:142
translate english ch8_C1_bd9e592b:

    # n "看着「再付300」的要求，阿狐心里突然咯噔一下。"
    n "Seeing the demand to \"pay another 300\", Ahu's heart suddenly skipped."

# game/ch08.rpy:143
translate english ch8_C1_31a99c72:

    # think serious "不对！哪有下单之后还要交「激活费」的？老师说过，付费名目一个接一个，就是连环骗局！"
    think serious "Wait! Since when do orders need an \"activation fee\" afterwards? Teacher said fees piling up one after another means a chain scam!"

# game/ch08.rpy:144
translate english ch8_C1_838e533b:

    # mc serious "我不付了！你是假卖家，退还我的定金，不然我举报你！"
    mc serious "I'm not paying! You're a fake seller — return my deposit, or I'm reporting you!"

# game/ch08.rpy:145
translate english ch8_C1_fa1773a3:

    # n "阿狐截图保留证据，向平台和市场监管渠道举报了这家店，并把经过告诉妈妈。妈妈补上了官方店的到货提醒。"
    n "Ahu kept screenshots as evidence, reported the shop to the platform and market regulators, and told Mom the story. She added the official store restock alert for him."

# game/ch08.rpy:148
translate english ch8_C1_dbbbc670:

    # police serious "及时止损、保留证据、依法举报，三步全对！记住：正常的网购，付款一次就结束，后面不停要钱的，全是骗局！"
    police serious "Stop losses, keep evidence, report legally — all three steps perfect! Remember: normal online shopping ends with ONE payment. Anything that keeps charging afterward is a scam!"

# game/ch08.rpy:160
translate english ch8_C2_eeaba110:

    # n "阿狐舍不得50元定金和到手的漫画，决定先付100元「部分激活费」。"
    n "Unable to part with the 50-yuan deposit and the comics, Ahu decided to pay 100 yuan as a \"partial activation fee\"."

# game/ch08.rpy:161
translate english ch8_C2_d2e30d59:

    # think laugh "先付100表个诚意，说不定卖家就给我发货了。"
    think laugh "Pay 100 as a show of good faith — maybe the seller will ship after all."

# game/ch08.rpy:162
translate english ch8_C2_7da1730e:

    # n "100元转过去，对方又发来消息：激活需全额300元，已付部分不予退还。"
    n "The 100 yuan went through, then another message: activation requires the full 300 yuan — partial payments are non-refundable."

# game/ch08.rpy:163
translate english ch8_C2_52209850:

    # mc confused "说好的激活，怎么又要凑全额？"
    mc confused "Wasn't 100 for activation? Now it needs the full amount?"

# game/ch08.rpy:164
translate english ch8_C2_fc65c294:

    # n "阿狐把事情告诉妈妈，妈妈判断是连环骗局，那150元已无法追回。"
    n "Ahu told Mom. She judged it a chain scam — the 150 yuan was unrecoverable."

# game/ch08.rpy:167
translate english ch8_C2_029e9c45:

    # police serious "骗子的收费永远「还差最后一步」！对付连环骗局只有一招：一分钱都不要再付，马上止损、保留证据、告诉家长！"
    police serious "A scammer's fees are always \"one step short\"! Against chain scams there's only one move: not one cent more — cut losses, keep evidence, tell your parents!"

# game/ch08.rpy:179
translate english ch8_C3_9bf78a2f:

    # n "阿狐怕定金作废，咬牙付了300元「激活费」。"
    n "Fearing his deposit would go to waste, Ahu gritted his teeth and paid the 300-yuan \"activation fee\"."

# game/ch08.rpy:180
translate english ch8_C3_e323219d:

    # n "对方又接连以「物流保证金」「未成年人订单审核费」为由要钱，阿狐前前后后转了650元，漫画始终没有踪影。"
    n "The scammer kept inventing reasons — \"logistics deposit\", \"minor order review fee\" — and Ahu transferred 650 yuan in total. The comics never appeared."

# game/ch08.rpy:181
translate english ch8_C3_1aa76f71:

    # n "再发消息，微信显示：对方已开启朋友验证——他被拉黑了。那个小店，也在平台上消失了。"
    n "When he messaged again, WeChat showed: friend verification required — he'd been blocked. And the little shop vanished from the platform too."

# game/ch08.rpy:182
translate english ch8_C3_336d71a8:

    # mc sad "漫画没买到，零花钱全没了……"
    mc sad "No comics, and all my allowance is gone..."

# game/ch08.rpy:183
translate english ch8_C3_7c2f9219:

    # n "阿狐向妈妈坦白了一切，妈妈陪他报了警，留了证据。"
    n "Ahu confessed everything to Mom. She went with him to report to the police and kept the evidence."

# game/ch08.rpy:184
translate english ch8_C3_fd4a87d2:

    # mom normal "记住这次教训：买东西宁可多等等，也绝不私下转账。"
    mom normal "Remember this lesson: better to wait longer for a purchase than ever transfer privately."

# game/ch08.rpy:187
translate english ch8_C3_67b11b17:

    # police serious "小朋友记住！「虚假网购」两板斧：超低价引你上钩，绕开平台骗你转账。认准官方店铺，钱货两清走平台，私下转账都是坑！"
    police serious "Kids, remember! The \"fake online shop\" has two moves: rock-bottom prices to hook you, then bypassing the platform to steal your transfer. Trust official stores, keep money-and-goods on the platform — private transfers are always a trap!"

